<title>GERMANY: TABLE-Buba revises June Pan-German ind orders up.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Buba revises June Pan-German ind orders up.</headline>
<dateline>BONN 1997-08-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bundesbank provided the following revised index figures:</p>
<p>    PAN-GERMAN INDUSTRY ORDERS  June 97	   May 97</p>
<p> Month-on-month change(pct)	 +2.1	     -1.4</p>
<p> Year-on-year (pct)		   +5.6	     +5.1</p>
<p> Index (base 1991)		   103.9 (103.3)  101.8 (101.9)</p>
<p>WEST GERMAN INDUSTRY ORDERS</p>
<p> Month-on-month change(pct)	 +2.3	     -1.5</p>
<p> Year-on-year (pct)		   +5.8	     +4.7</p>
<p> Index (base 1991)		   102.0 (101.4)   99.7</p>
<p>EAST GERMAN INDUSTRY ORDERS</p>
<p> Month-on-month change(pct)	 -2.6	     +2.6</p>
<p> Year-on-year (pct)		   +2.3	    +10.8</p>
<p> Index (base 1991)		   151.5 (150.5)  155.5</p>
<p>NOTE - Figures are seasonally adjusted. The percentage change figures are calculated by Reuters from the indices. Previously announced data in brackets.</p>
<p>-- Bonn newsroom, 49-228-26097150</p>
</text>
